## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: Economy
## Notes: A tab Deals on the game's auction house window, open first: what is cheap right now and worth buying to sell on, and what of yours, on any character, is worth selling right now, each a click away; and how much gold you have on sale, in the window's corner. From the prices your full scans gather. And a tab Banker on the mail window, open first: your banker's name remembered, and every trade good and reagent in your bags sent to it with one Send.
## Author: Saneroki
## Version: 0.3.0
## Category: Sane UI
## Group: SaneUI
## Dependencies: SaneUI
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\SaneUI_Economy\Art\icon
