# The module's own table, its words, sizes and settings. First: the other files will add to that table.
Economy.lua
# What is worth buying and what worth selling right now: plain lists over Core's prices and the characters' data
Deals.lua
# What the server says of the items in sight, asked one at a time: a purchase goes by that, never by a scan
Live.lua
# A purchase and a post, each from a click of the player
Trade.lua
# The tab on the game's window, its two columns, the gold on sale in the corner
Tab.lua
# The tab on the game's mail window: the trade goods and reagents sent to your banker
Banker.lua
